# Static files in this directory are served as-is and never hit the SPA
# fallback: /favicon.ico /favicon.svg /apple-touch-icon.png /icon-192.png
# /icon-512.png /icon-maskable-512.png /book/ and any other real file.
#
# Known marketing paths keep a 200 SPA shell. Everything else that is not
# a real file used to be `/* /index.html 200`, which made guessed URLs
# look like a successful homepage load. Serve those as 404; the client
# still gets index.html and renders the NotFound view.

/services     /index.html   200
/services/    /index.html   200
/about        /index.html   200
/about/       /index.html   200
/apply        /index.html   200
/apply/       /index.html   200

/*            /index.html   404
